<title>SWEDEN: Volvo U.S. car sales rose 2.2 pct July.</title>
<headline>Volvo U.S. car sales rose 2.2 pct July.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish vehicle maker AB Volvo said on  Friday that its car sales in the U.S. rose 2.2 percent in July to  7,551 vehicles.  </p>
<p>This was compared to the same month a year ago.</p>
<p>So far this year Volvo has sold 56,075 cars in the U.S. which is a  2.1 percent increase on the same period last year.</p>
<p>In Canada Volvo has sold 5,921 cars this year which is 22.3 percent  more than a year ago.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
